          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1329\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Tosca: Royal Opera\",\"date_release_date\":\"2027-05-05\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Floria Tosca and Mario Cavaradossi live for each other and for their art. But when Cavaradossi helps an escaped prisoner, the lovers make a deadly enemy in the form of Baron Scarpia, Chief of Police. At&nbsp;the mercy of Scarpia&rsquo;s twisted desires, Tosca is forced to make a horrific bargain: sleeping with the&nbsp;man she hates, in order to save the man she loves. Can she find a way out?&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Oliver Mears&rsquo;s acclaimed production returns, setting Puccini&rsquo;s operatic thriller in a contemporary,&nbsp;war-torn Rome. Daniel Oren conducts Aleksandra Kurzak, who returns to the title role, joined by&nbsp;Saimir Pirgu as Cavaradossi and Christopher Maltman as Baron Scarpia.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be 2 intervals during this production.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820806432627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Tosca_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820806422627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Tosca_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"tosca-2027\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/tosca-2027?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-05-09\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"duration\":\"3h 25m\",\"movie_year\":\"2027\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"61\",\"name\":\"Ballet and Opera\",\"short_name\":\"ballet_ope\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_i