          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1540\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Exhibition on Screen: Monet\",\"date_release_date\":\"2027-05-11\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Art\"},{\"name\":\"Documentary\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>To celebrate Tate Britain&rsquo;s blockbuster Monet and Time exhibition, Exhibition on Screen is delighted to bring the iconic story of Claude Monet to cinema screens in May 2027. Undeniably one of the world&rsquo;s favourite artists and the figurehead of the Impressionist movement prepare to be dazzled by his spectacular and revolutionary use of light and colour and step into one the most famous gardens in art history. Immerse yourself in iconic masterpieces and discover the incredible story of passion and rebellion in this exciting documentary on the man who named the world&rsquo;s favourite art movement.<\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1787671730Claude_Monet,_Rouen_Cathedral,_West_Facade,_Sunlight.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/1787671729images_4.webp\",\"url_key\":\"eos-monet\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/eos-monet?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-05-11\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":false,\"duration\":\"1h 50m\",\"movie_year\":\"2027\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[{\"id\":\"38\",\"name\":\"Event Cinema\",\"short_name\":\"event cine\",\"description\":\"\"},{\"id\":\"44\",\"name\":\"Exhibition on Screen\",\"short_name\":\"Exhibition\",\"description\":\"\"}],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking