          "redirectURL": "",
          "content": {
            "mimeType": "application/json; charset=utf-8",
            "text": "{\"status\":true,\"data\":{\"movies\":[{\"movie_id\":\"1330\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"movie_name\":\"Romeo and Juliet: Royal Ballet\",\"date_release_date\":\"2027-05-25\",\"movie_end_date\":null,\"movie_countries\":\"\",\"genre\":[{\"name\":\"Opera and Ballet\"}],\"synopsis\":\"<p>Shakespeare&rsquo;s timeless tale of star-crossed lovers is transformed in Kenneth MacMillan&rsquo;s&nbsp;mesmerising ballet. The flourishing of young love is just as present in Romeo and&nbsp; Juliet's meeting on&nbsp;the balcony as in their final moments when they desperately cling to life in the tomb.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>Prokofiev&rsquo;s&nbsp;evocative music sets the scene for stolen romantic moments and deadly feuds and sweeps the ballet&nbsp;towards its inevitable and tragic conclusion.<\\/p>\\r\\n<p>&nbsp;<\\/p>\\r\\n<p><span style=\\\"text-decoration: underline;\\\">There will be 2 intervals during this performance.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"portrait_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820813412627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Romeo-and-Juliet_-_Portrait.webp\",\"landscape_image\":\"https:\\/\\/lumiereromford.static.cinesync.io\\/images\\/movie\\/17820813412627_RBO_Cinema_Web_Thumbnail_Romeo-and-Juliet_-_Landscape.webp\",\"url_key\":\"romeo-and-juliet-2027\",\"page_link\":\"https:\\/\\/www.lumiereromford.com\\/movies\\/romeo-and-juliet-2027?location=romford&locationKey=4\",\"session_start_date\":\"2027-05-25\",\"imdb_rate\":\"0.0\",\"trailer\":\"https:\\/\\/www.youtube.com\\/watch?v=eRR1FiG__FU\",\"trailer_type\":\"1\",\"trailer_id\":\"eRR1FiG__FU\",\"duration\":\"3h 0m\",\"movie_year\":\"2027\",\"cast\":[],\"directed_by\":[],\"movie_tags\":[],\"movie_language\":[],\"movie_certification_type_id\":\"0\",\"movie_certification_logo\":null,\"movie_certification_name\":null,\"movie_certification_short_code\":\"N\\/A\",\"movie_certification_description\":null,\"is_restricted_mode\":false,\"is_booking_open\":true,\"is_coming_soon\":false,\"is_this